{title: 269 - Come, Holy Spirit}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #269 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 269}
{meta: category Holy Spirit - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Come, Holy [Am]Spir[E]it, [Am]heaven[D]ly [G]Dove, [Am7]With [G]all [D]Thy [G]quick[A7]ening [D]powers;
[Am]Kindle [E7]a[Am]flame [A7]of [D]sa[A7]cred [D]lo[D7]ve [G]In [C2]these [C]cold [G]hearts [D]of [G]ours.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G][Am]O [E][Am]raise [D][G]our [Am7]thoughts [G][D]from [G][A7]things [D]below,
[Am][E7][Am][A7]From [D][A7][D]vanities [D7][G][C2][C]and [G][D][G]toys!
[G][Am]Then [E][Am]shall [D][G]we [Am7]with [G][D]fresh [G][A7]courage [D]go
[Am][E7][Am][A7]To [D][A7][D]reach [D7][G][C2][C]eternal [G][D][G]joys.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G][Am]Awake [E][Am]our [D][G]souls [Am7][G]to [D][G]joyful [A7][D]songs;
[Am][E7][Am][A7]Let [D][A7][D]pure [D7][G][C2][C]devotions [G][D][G]rise;
[G][Am]Till [E][Am]praise [D][G]employs [Am7][G]our [D][G]thankful [A7][D]tongues,
[Am][E7][Am][A7]And [D][A7][D]doubt [D7][G][C2][C]forever [G][D][G]dies.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G][Am]Father, [E][Am]we [D][G]would [Am7][G]no [D][G]longer [A7][D]live
[Am][E7][Am]At [A7][D][A7]this [D][D7][G]poor, [C2][C][G]dying [D][G]rate;
[G][Am]To [E][Am]Thee [D][G]our [Am7]thankful [G][D]love [G][A7]we [D]give,
[Am][E7][Am]For [A7][D]Thine [A7][D]to [D7][G][C2]us [C][G]is [D][G]great.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[G][Am][E]Come, [Am][D]Holy [G][Am7][G]Spirit, [D][G]heavenly [A7][D]Dove,
[Am][E7][Am]With [A7][D][A7]all [D][D7][G]Thy [C2][C][G]quickening [D][G]powers;
[G][Am]Come, [E][Am]shed [D][G]abroad [Am7][G]a [D][G]Savior's [A7][D]love,
[Am][E7][Am]And [A7][D][A7]that [D][D7][G]shall [C2][C][G]kindle [D][G]ours.
{end_of_verse}
